# Build output and tool residue
/target/
**/target/
*.profraw
*.profdata
coverage*
/dist/
/results/
*.tmp
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
.DS_Store

# Internal, never-published documents. Public docs live in docs/ and scenarios/.
/TODO.md
/internal/
/docs/reviews/
